        <p class="font-sans text-sm text-zonura-sand/60 max-w-xs leading-relaxed">
          Aura of Wellness. Clean, modern, premium everyday self-care products for the modern Indian lifestyle.
        </p>
        <div class="flex items-center gap-4 text-zonura-sand">
